          },
          {
            "title": "Decide the whole plan before opening outputs",
            "text": "Validate the interface, every row, required inputs and all path conflicts before changing a file. A changed job needs an independent old-current rollback. An unchanged job preserves the existing rollback or its absence. Protected input and keep.txt must remain intact."
